{"id":"wb-8-337","name":"浮梁红塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"浮梁红塔","text":"大圣宝塔位于中国江西省景德镇市浮梁县浮梁镇古县衙南侧，俗称“红塔”，又称“西塔”，北宋建隆二年（961年）建造，明万历三年（1575年）重修，为楼阁式砖塔，六面九层，高40.47米。1959年被列为江西省文物保护单位。1984年景德镇市人民政府对红塔进行重修，历时两年，全面修复对外开放。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B5%AE%E6%A2%81%E7%BA%A2%E5%A1%94","revisionId":86544502,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86544502","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/28dd697aebffd4c9c134b210.jpg","title":"Dasheng_Baota,_2021-09-24_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Dasheng_Baota,_2021-09-24_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/Dasheng_Baota%2C_2021-09-24_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​浮梁红塔国保碑","width":320,"height":214}}